ate if you don't stop enemy propaganda. We need right self-criticism, without despising ourself. We need to notice what things we have to correct or improve, but without allowing hummilliations or psychological abuse by toxic people or rivals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly? If you're looking to celebrate your heritage, maybe Columbus isn't the best tact to use. It's impossible to decouple Columbus' name from genocide. His entire career track came from stumbling upon a nation and enslaving and murdering its people. If that's what you want to celebrate, you're openly inviting criticism. Native Americans are still feeling the effects of Columbus' arrival, effects that have resulted in them becoming second class citizens on the verge of extinction. It's incredibly tone deaf to fly that flag and then be offended when the injured parties don't respond.<br /> <br /> It would be like Belgium celebrating &quot;King Leopold Day&quot; as a way to be proud of their heritage and relationship with Africa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T10:46:27-07:00","id":986219,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986116#post986116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <di