be careful, because Northamerica could suffer the same fate if you don't stop enemy propaganda. We need right self-criticism, without despising ourself. We need to notice what things we have to correct or improve, but without allowing hummilliations or psychological abuse by toxic people or rivals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Implying that Northamerica doesn't have a big guilt culture already.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","user":"LokiRavenSpeak","date":". 10-12-2016, 02:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:08:21-07:00","id":986228,"title":"","content":"I remember the movie &quot;Stargate&quot; when the american destroyed with a nuclear bomb Ra's pyramid spaceship... and I don't see American to be ashamed about it. (X-D) Are Frenchs ashamed by Napoleon?<br /> <br /> Some horrible things happened in the American conquest, but we weren't the evil empire, but we were the first ones who learnt to be not so evil. Why not to talk about the different of Northamerican native-borns on borth sides of Rio Grande, the zones discovered by Spanish explores and by yankis. Where there are more native-borns now? In the Hispanoamerican empire the Americans had the same rights and duties than Europeans. Some rotten aplles, yes, but it wasn't the normal. We weren't the worst, but only we lost the propaganda war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\