double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember the movie &quot;Stargate&quot; when the american destroyed with a nuclear bomb a Ra's pyramid spaceship... and I don't see American to be ashamed about it. (X-D) Are Frenchs ashamed by Napoleon?</div> </div> </div> </div>Um....dude....that wasn't real.<br /> <br /> And the real bombings we HAVE done, yes, there are massive movements and reparations for those events. Hiroshima and Nagasaki, damn near the entire Middle East currently, just to name a few.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:28:09-07:00","id":986245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986239#post986239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And the real bombings we HAVE done, yes, there are massive movements and reparations for those events. Hiroshima and Nagasaki, damn near the entire Middle East currently, just to name a few.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sadako_and_the_Thousand_Paper_Cranes\" target=\"_blank\">Sadako and the Thousand Cranes</a> is a book taught in many American Schools. I read it when I was in school.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:30:23-07:00","id":986248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986228#post986228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember the movie &quot;Stargate&quot; when the american destroyed with a nuclear bomb Ra's pyramid spaceship... and I don't see American to be ashamed about it. (X-D) Are Frenchs ashamed by Napoleon?</div> </div> </div> </div>America's relationship with the attacks on Hiroshima and Nagasaki is incredibly troubling, and it's something we need to work on.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986228#post986228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some horrible things happened in the American conquest, but we weren't the evil empire, but we were the first ones who learnt to be not so evil. Why not to talk about the different of Northamerican native-borns on borth sides of Rio Grande, the zones discovered by Spanish explores and by yankis. Where there are more native-borns now? In the Hispanoamerican empire the Americans had the same rights and duties than Europeans. Some rotten aplles, yes, but it wasn't the normal. We weren't the worst, but only we lost the propaganda war.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Some rotten apples&quot; strikes me as a gross understatement. Are you trying to argue that the conquest of the Americas was some noble endeavor with tragically unintended consequences? It rings even more false when the holiday is designed to explicitly celebrate one of the most rotten of those apples. No one is trying to say that everyone involved in the endeavor was mustache-twirling villains, but it was a genocide, and those &quot;triumphs&quot; you're talking about that hardly reach the enormity of how much it decimated the native people.<br /> <br /> Nor is this about beating down exclusively on the Spanish. Columbus Day was promoted in America as a celebration of the Italian-American experience. It has become a celebration of transplant American pride. Celebrating Columbus' heritage is just twisting the knife for the people who were completely devastated by the conquest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:35:56-07:00","id":986255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986245#post986245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sadako_and_the_Thousand_Paper_Cranes\" target=\"_blank\">Sadako and the Thousand Cranes</a> is a book taught in many American Schools. I read it when I was in school.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Danish schools too for that sake.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:47:58-07:00","id":986267,"title":"","content":"Speaking of the Atomic bomb, how do you think History will remember Harry S Truman, the American President that made the decision to use the Atomic bomb on Japan? I've read a <a href=\"http://www.ushistory.org/us/51g.asp\" target=\"_blank\">few articles on the topic</a>, but people seem divided on his decision.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:49:59-07:00","id":986271,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=985998#post985998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How to explain it better? English isn't my naive languange. Let's imagine you end a hard work day, but you discover your car has been destroyed by vandals. A cop has been seing all, but he only fines you because it was badly parked, and you talk about that, you are answered: &quot;Don't complain, your great-grandfather was a highwayman). That is like I feel when I read about Christians suffering persecution and injustices in all world, and after I find fiction with the same anti-Christians predjudices. Don't talk about crusders, but let's talk about a backery was reported because they are Christians and didn't want make a wedding cake for a gay couple. Are you quiet when the censorships is to stop homophobia or islamophobia?</div> </div> </div> </div>When your go-to claim of persecution is a government that won't let you persecute someone else, there's something wrong and you need to reevaluate your position in a society that is largely Christian, and influenced by Christians. Because while you're upset about having to make a wedding cake (which by the way, you needn't attend, so let's drop that please?) Presidential Candidates are being shamed for not being Christian. Transgender people are being raped and then set on fire, and black people are being shot with minimal prompting.<br /> <br /> You don't know what persecution is, alright? Some of us have lived these things, so comparing 'you have to serve your customers' with 'someone vandalized your vehicle' is not only excessive, it's insensitive and indicative of a persecution complex.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=985998#post985998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I make remember you again from here the news I read are different. What do you know about the &quot;pussy riot&quot; in Madrid, the topless church protest by Rita Maestre, council of the group &quot;Ahora Madrid&quot;? or radical feminists trying assault a Catholic cathedral in Argentina. Do you know nothing about the destruction by vandalic acts by radical pro-abortion activist in the cathedral of Santiago de Chile in July 25th 2013? and am I who has to feel guilty about the facts from the past? Can you suposse how I feel when after I read &quot;preacher&quot; teleserie will be renewed for a new season?</div> </div> </div> </div>Really? The Pussy Riot in Madrid?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://twitter.com/UrdinUrdin/status/699086791945691136/photo/1\" target=\"_blank\">http://twitter.com/UrdinUrdin/status...691136/photo/1</a> Doesn't exactly look topless to me. More to the point, who the hell cares? A single person protesting that the church is abusive and bigoted does not discrimination make. Let's talk about the Pussy Riots in Moscow, shall we? Where people were arrested without bail and then held in prison for two years because they behaved 'provocatively'. In other words, because they dare criticize the church. <br /> <br /> What's worse is that you don't seem to understand how citing those examples as persecution against 'you' as opposed to persecution against women and lgbt people (Russia has a wonderful number of human rights violations) actually makes your cases of genuine harassment seem less valid. No, obviously vandalizing a church is not okay, and is illegal for a reason. That's still not persecution, people are lashing out at your organization because that organization denies them personal rights. I'm not sure how it is in Spain, but in America Freedom of Religion is a thing, which is to say that one religion cannot force its beliefs upon you. Persecution starts when the society in some way enables the harassment. Again, black people getting shot and police officers not suffering consequences. Transgender people getting murdered and then the killer is let off with manslaughter charges. An act of harassment against your group does not mean your group is some minority group being persecuted against.<br /> <br /> As for Preacher, I suspect you'll just have to watch the movie version of Constantine, or the more recent 'Of Kings and Prophets'. One series that makes you look bad is not a sweeping takeover by the media. You get the Chronicles of Narnia, we get His Dark Materials.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=985998#post985998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I invite, or I challenge you, to read news from fides.org, to notice about the real situation of Christians in another places of the world. What do you know about the patriotic church, created and controlled by Chinese dictatorship, the only Christian faith allowed in China? or the kidnapping of Christians Copt girls in Egypt to be forced to corvent to islam and marry Muslim men. In the current age, the persecutions againts Christiany is causing more victims than in the Roman empire.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because why read the news from more objective sources when you can get it from the Vatican itself, right? I mean, it's not like <i>they</i> ever tried to tip the scales when it comes to reporting and facts.<br /> <br /> There is some Christian persecution in parts of the world that are not primarily Christian, yes. But their suffering does not extend to you. You do not live in Egypt, or Saudi Arabia. You do not live in China. Claiming persecution because the show 'Preacer' is getting renewed for another season is asinine when you compare yourself to people who are actually being hurt. Being forced to convert and then raped is persecution, being forced to make a cake is not. And no, you don't get to reinforce your cake position because someone is suffering in a distant land.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=985998#post985998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe in your country Christian faith is still respected, but here we live a lot of anti-Christian feeling in the media. Madonna's &quot;Like a virgin&quot; videoclip is Sesame Street next to some things I have seen, for example blaspheme photographies from a expositure in Spain(paid with public money, with our taxes!!!). I have seen with my own eyes some nasty pictures in the news about that. That wasn't freedom speech, but anti-Christian hate.</div> </div> </div> </div>So when you slander other groups it's freedom of speech (ie gays, women, transgender people) but when they 'blaspheme' Christianity it's Hate Speech? I'll remind you that the word 'Blaspheme' literally means showing a lack of respect for God. There's nothing innately 'hatespeech' about it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=985998#post985998\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* The pasternoster is the lord's prayer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not in the context it was used.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11726-solana","name":"Solana","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11726_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"342"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T11:57:55-07:00","id":986277,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986267#post986267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of the Atomic bomb, how do you think History will remember Harry S Truman, the American President that made the decision to use the Atomic bomb on Japan? I've read a <a href=\"http://www.ushistory.org/us/51g.asp\" target=\"_blank\">few articles on the topic</a>, but people seem divided on his decision.</div> </div> </div> </div>So I think probably most military historians today are of the opinion that the Japanese threat at that stage of the war was greatly exaggerated. Whether or not Truman himself and his chiefs of staff realized this or not is difficult to discern. There may have been a certain amount of racism propelling that attitude, too.<br /> <br /> So on the one hand, we know that the Japanese were on the verge of surrendering already, making the dropping of the bombs <i>unnecessary</i> from a direct military standpoint, but how aware Truman was of that would change how <i>reasonable</i> it was from his perspective.<br /> <br /> Further, there's also the question as to how much motivation there was in sending a message to the Soviets, which is... some disturbing realpolitik if so, but at least a potentially viable propaganda move in preparation for what pretty much everyone believed would be the next great war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T12:02:02-07:00","id":986285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986202#post986202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am suffering a lot of comments by liberald who id tellinh every time we should be ashamed about the American conquest/genocide. Can you believe it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Uh, yes. I can certainly believe that? Genocide is a pretty horrendous thing, especially since a lot of the Spanish butchered villages in pursuit of gold, or enslaved them to mine silver, or enslaved them to harvest sugar. Let's not forget that wonderful time where the Spanish rounded up all the books and manuscripts written by Mayan natives and then burned them, and attempted to stomp out their beliefs and their very language. There's also that nice bit where cultures in the mesoamericas were much keener on gender variance and transgender individuals before the Spanish showed up, and shoved Catholicism down their throats. We now have a serious problem with the way Hispanic people deal with such behaviors, as well as sex, to the point where trans hispanic prostitutes are in a very dangerous social position. That's something their culture (and those of us who inhabit the same region) are dealing with. So... Thanks for that, I suppose?<br /> <br /> No one's asking you to blame yourself on a personal level for what happened, but what you are arguing for borders on denial. &quot;It's over, it's in the past, let it go.&quot; Except it's not in the past, all of those actions have real world consequences today that -we- are grappling with. At the least, you can spare a day out of the year to reflect on how your ancestors did wrong, <i>why</i> it was wrong, and take steps to make sure it never happens in the future.<br /> <br /> You know, by like, not insisting that everyone follows the tenets of your religion, otherwise you're being persecuted/God is being blasphemed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986228#post986228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I remember the movie &quot;Stargate&quot; when the american destroyed with a nuclear bomb Ra's pyramid spaceship... and I don't see American to be ashamed about it. (X-D) Are Frenchs ashamed by Napoleon?</div> </div> </div> </div>Stargate was a fictional incident, Ra doesn't actually have a pyramid spaceship. Americans feel pretty bad about the Trail of Tears, indoctrination of Native children, Slavery, Japanese Internment Camps, etc.<br /> <br /> And yes, I know plenty of French people who are ashamed of Napoleon. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986228#post986228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some horrible things happened in the American conquest, but we weren't the evil empire, but we were the first ones who learnt to be not so evil. Why not to talk about the different of Northamerican native-borns on borth sides of Rio Grande, the zones discovered by Spanish explores and by yankis. Where there are more native-borns now?</div> </div> </div> </div>At the time of those events? Yes, you were an evil empire. If you're going to call the people in Egypt or Saudi Arabia 'Evil' then the Spanish were by all definitions an Evil Empire in the west.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luis Carlos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=986228#post986228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the Hispanoamerican empire the Americans had the same rights and duties than Europeans. Some rotten aplles, yes, but it wasn't the normal. We weren't the worst, but only we lost the propaganda war.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is an outright lie, and I'm speaking as someone who grew up in formerly Spanish controlled regions, and who cares a lot about the native peoples and beliefs of the region, and have spent a great measure of time studying them.","signature":""