\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=987288#post987288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose Paul just &quot;discovered&quot; Rome?</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't conflate &quot;Rome&quot; and &quot;the West&quot;. Western civilization have various foundations, but we can only start talking about it after Europe was converted. There's no real continuity between the Romans and the Western civilization, but there's a continuity between Christian Europe and the West today.<br /> <br /> By the Way, I'm not saying Christiniaty = &quot;the West&quot;. Roman-Germanic-Canon Law, Greek Philosophy, and Christian Theology were the main influences. Before those three pillars, it's impossible to talk about a Western Civilization.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1119-primal-flame","name":"Primal Flame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:26:41-07:00","id":987300,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primal Flame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=987282#post987282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Westerns civilization was created by Christianity. Greeks and Romans provided our foundations, yes, but the Christian doctrine unified all the previous influences.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Um.....yeah......wow........I have no words for that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:26:53-07:00","id":987301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primal Flame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=987294#post987294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's no real continuity between the Romans and the Western civilization, but there's a continuity between Christian Europe and the West today.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with this sentence only inasmuch as the conversion to Christianity was a significant part of Rome's collapse as an empire. It's like saying there's no continuity between &quot;A&quot; and &quot;C&quot; because there's this &quot;B&quot; in the middle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:27:12-07:00","id":987304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primal Flame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=987294#post987294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Don't conflate &quot;Rome&quot; and &quot;the West&quot;. Western civilization have various foundations, but we can only start talking about it after Europe was converted. There's no real continuity between the Romans and the Western civilization, but there's a continuity between Christian Europe and the West today.<br /> <br /> By the Way, I'm not saying Christiniaty = &quot;the West&quot;. Roman-Germanic-Canon Law, Greek Philosophy, and Christian Theology were the main influences. Before those three pillars, it's impossible to talk about a Western Civilization.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's hard to decipher what influences your own culture when you are living in the culture. If you ever talk to someone from Asian, they will say Christian values are deeply embedded in Western Culture. I don't believe Christianity invented Western Culture. Western Culture is a continuous evolution of the culture of a specific population. <br /> <br /> Ideally Secularism isn't to suppress religion. What Secularism is attempting to do is to limit any one sect of a religion from using the government as an arm of their religion. We have a lot of instances in the Bible Belt of the US where public school teach religious education. A secular government would not tolerate this situation, yet a secular government should not inhibit other private avenues of religious education.<br /> <br /> Of course I believe there is a difference between Parenting (in which raising your children in your religion is a part of) and Educating (in which society prepares the next generation to take over from the previous ones.) Confusing the two concepts causing a lot of grief in politics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:46:11-07:00","id":987313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/979988-any-conservative-gamers-around-yes-we-do-exist?p=987301#post987301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I agree with this sentence only inasmuch as the conversion to Christianity was a significant part of Rome's collapse as an empire. It's like saying there's no continuity between &quot;A&quot; and &quot;C&quot; because there's this &quot;B&quot; in the middle.</div> </div> </div> </div>All contemporary historiography denies Christianity &quot;was a significant part of Rome's collapse&quot;.<br /> <br /> Economics and politics destroyed the Western part of the Empire. The Eastern half of the Empire, Christian, survived for another thousand years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1119-primal-flame","name":"Primal Flame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T09:51:33-07:00","id":987316,"title":"","content":"It would be much easier if you guys could just confess you hate Christianity and Christians. No moderator is going to suspended or ban you for that. Just don't point out any peccadillo of religious &quot;minorities&quot;, ever, haha.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1119-primal-flame","name":"Primal Flame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1119_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"230"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-14T10:05:59-07:00","id":987319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally post