ema). Sodoma had been forgiven with only ten just men living there.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">, I take no pleasure in the death of the wicked, but rather that they turn from their ways and live.</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> Turn!</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> Turn from your evil ways! </span></span></span>&amp;quot; Ezekiel 33 11.<br /> <br /> Sorry, you can't use the past to try manipulate by means of guilty feelings. This doesn't work like this. Self-criticism doesn't mean self-hate. Now it is time to say to defend freedom, tolerance and human rights, we must report the anti-Christian hate. Some horrible things in the past happened, but we learnt the lesson to not repeat the same mistakes. Now the priority is to defende Christians who suffer harassments and persecutions in another places.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, sorry, I'm against pedophilia because it involves impaired consent. It's why I'm for same sex and polyamorus relationships but am against bestiality and pedophilia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>We don't allow mages to cast spells, since this is the most unbalancing rule of all.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5226-jachra","name":"Jachra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T16:01:38-07:00","id":988485,"title":"","content":"Christian Conservative here! Hi from the new guy!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_lin